# MadrassaPlay V2 — Deferred items only (not in current release)

This file lists good ideas we will NOT implement now, reserved for the next version.

## Admin (Templates)
- Deprecate lifecycle state for templates (hide from new creations but keep existing playable).
- Preflight validation UI on template upload (manifest/schema/engine entry checks before sending to server).
- Default settings UI (edit `defaultConfigOverrides` per template) to pre-fill Create form values.
- Template icon file upload control in Template Meta (call `/:id/media?usage=icon` from the UI).
- Per-template storage dashboard: creations count, results count, total storage under `/uploads/templates/<templateId>`.
- "Clean Draft Uploads" action to remove `/creations/draft` files older than X days.
- Asset policy UI: configure allowed MIME types per template and optional max image size hint (server remains authoritative).
- Audit log of admin actions (upload, publish, delete, deprecate, meta changes).
- Role-based restrictions per template (e.g., some templates admin-only).

## Badges (Template Awards)
- Show usage stats: number of users awarded, per-tier distribution.
- Quick presets and reordering UX refinements beyond threshold auto-sort.

## Engines & Storage
- Engine versioning/migration guidance: display engineVersion in admin and warn when creations use older engine versions.
- Per-template `assets.allowedMimeTypes` (UI + enforcement on upload routes).
- Storage quotas and warnings per template or globally (soft limits with admin override).

## Maintenance & Ops
- Background job to purge orphaned uploads not referenced by any creation.
- Health page to validate static routes (/engines, /uploads, /badge-icons) and write permissions.
